  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#br-wbr-content\r\n\r\n> br \\{ display\\-outside:​ newline; \\} /\\* this also has bidi implications \\*/ nobr \\{ white\\-space:​ nowrap; \\} wbr \\{ display\\-outside:​ break\\-opportunity; \\} /\\* this also has bidi implications \\*/ \r\n\r\nThe rules for `wbr/br` uses a `display-outside` property which no longer exist in the relevant [CSS spec](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display/#the-display-properties). (And `newline` and `break-opportunity` aren't valid `display` values either.)",
